text=Marimbo is worshipped by the monkeys of Ape Atoll and party animals.<br>She threw a huge party in the Third Age for the end of the God Wars, even though the edicts meant she would have to leave her followers.<br>Now she is back for more, and she's promising her followers a wild time!
